# ScriptPlayerActor: Agon Wastes 03_sand_temple_dark (42b935e4) layer 10: e0024022f "Samus DarkSuit"
# (flags 0x5: suit swap 0x1, Deactivate resets 0x4; ACTV>INCR to itself) and e00240396 "Samus VariaSuit"
# (flags 0x7: + 0x2 alternate next suit). Both start inactive. Activate (LoadSuit(GetNextSuitCharIdx)),
# Increment (the 0x1 arm: AsyncLoadSuit, offline model), Left, Deactivate (0x4 falls into the reset),
# Reset while inactive, re-Activate and Delete.
@f260 layer 10
@f300 god 1; give darkSuit 1; give lightSuit 1
@f320 obj e0024022f; obj e00240396
@f340 send e0024022f Activate
@f360 send e00240396 Activate
@f700 obj e0024022f
@f720 send e0024022f Increment
@f740 send e00240396 Increment
@f1000 send e0024022f Left
@f1020 send e00240396 Deactivate
@f1040 send e00240396 Reset
@f1060 send e00240396 Activate
@f1400 send e0024022f Deactivate
@f1420 send e0024022f Activate
@f1700 send e0024022f Reset
@f1720 send e00240396 Delete
@f1800 obj e0024022f
